&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ethical Use: Users are expected to use this software responsibly and legally. If using a real person&amp;rsquo;s face, obtain their consent and clearly label any output as a deepfake when sharing online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Content Restrictions: The software includes built-in checks to prevent processing inappropriate media, such as nudity, graphic content, or sensitive material.&lt;/p&gt;
